<title>USA: Calif. College Agency $131 mln deal repriced.</title>
<headline>Calif. College Agency $131 mln deal repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Thursday it repriced California Community College Financing Authority's $131 million tax and revenue anticipation bonds.</p>
<p>CALIFORNIA COMMUNITY COLLEGE FINANCING AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $131,255,000*</p>
<p>1997 TAX AND REVENUE ANTICIPATION BONDS</p>
<p>Verbal award.</p>
<p>					    28,925,000*</p>
<p>					  Series A Bonds</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NAF		 S&amp;P: SP-1+		   10%</p>
<p>FSA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 07/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 06/30/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 06/30</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>06/30/1998	     28,925M    4.50  %	  3.78</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 100.691)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>Day Count Basis: 30/360</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>					    102,330,000*</p>
<p>					  Series B Bonds</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NAF		 S&amp;P: SP-1+	10% FSA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 07/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 06/30/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 09/30</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>09/30/1998	    102,330M    4.50  %	  4.05</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 100.534)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>Day Count Basis: 30/360</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, June 4, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Prudential Securities Incorporated</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
